  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a July 2025 official statement, Pedro M. Allende said that in Florida the department had built an AI use policy to address privacy and responsible-use risks. In 2026 DHS S&T announcements attributed to Allende described investing in next-generation tools to recognize biological risks and launching challenges intended to address evolving threats. A September 2026 statement said a challenge would help accelerate software capabilities for a more resilient biosurveillance posture. An August 2026 reported statement said detection algorithms are key to reducing false alarms that cause hands-on bag inspections and longer checkpoint wait times.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s4",
    "s5",
    "s6"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In a July 2025 official statement, Pedro M. Allende said that in Florida the department had built an AI use policy to address privacy and responsible-use risks.",
     "sids": [
